  "details": "If you're in the Beta then the update along with the Beta broke all controller bindings. I wasn't able to move using the joystick at all. It took me an hour just to fix everything but there needs to be a patch for this. I swear the game was literally unplayable thanks to this Beta and I'm NEVER going into Beta Mode again. Btw even if you go into steam settings to turn off beta mode and restart the game it's still gonna put you in beta mode now by default.  VRCHAT PLEASE FIX THIS!!!! 😭😭😭😭😭",
